{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "47957c396c4cd3011e85012fa135548ade8fda93fb0a38bf866e665e27c17f2a", "ja": "（夏祭りの盆踊りステージが終わった。山車の上で\n踊るエレナ、すごく楽しそうだったな）", "zh": "（夏日祭的盂兰盆舞台结束了。艾蕾娜在花车上\n跳舞时，看起来特别开心啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "c53d9a20964be6909bbc746eba71a2d79f0d17b003d8c1c8afa1ed3028eff1f4", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　ワタシのダンス、\nどうだった？　ちゃんとできてたかナ……？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！我的舞跳得怎么样？有没有好好跳好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4e28a87a1b1c1938a7f0c8559837bfe168e0170c99b3466d79965c25bfe8238a", "ja": "お疲れさま、よかったと思うぞ！\n見ていて、こっちまで踊りたくなったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，我觉得表现得很好！\n看得我都想跟着一起跳了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "e0e45df14f8aa00953121bce000fb3633646a970a8e83a08a27002979afbd3f0", "ja": "ホント！？　よかったヨ～♪　レッスンの時、\nテンポが速いって言われてたから、心配だったノ。", "zh": "真的！？太好了～♪ 练习的时候，大家都说节奏太快了，所以我还有点担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "e63a5f9f41e46570cf214145cd8b0429513b3f308dbae5cf3a3788082ab3a454", "ja": "盆踊りって、ゆっくりした曲もあるし、\n動きが独特だから、最初は難しかったナ～。", "zh": "盂兰盆舞也有节奏缓慢的曲子，而且动作很独特，所以一开始挺难的啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e366b579edb9d495d6974e000346f3d4b40692e1e6a23c547ab0ddcb8ca2ed1b", "ja": "確かに、レッスンではちょっと走り気味だったもんな。\nそれでもちゃんと仕上げたんだから、さすがだよ。", "zh": "确实，练习的时候节奏有点赶。\n不过还是好好完成了，真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "fc17dcf2ff31588107f8d5961d2ff79c127d4ddb1a3abb50fa40971948558a91", "ja": "エヘヘっ、盆踊りの先生のおかげだヨ～。\n盆踊りはネ、ナンバ歩きっていうのが基本なんだって。", "zh": "嘿嘿，多亏了教盆舞的老师哦～  \n听说盆舞的基本是交叉步行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "7d415518535a4b8db8e438984f1ff8850977a8d834a9afb03c0d966ec1d7bdb6", "ja": "右手と右足、左手と左足が、一緒に出るノ。\nそれを意識したら、ちゃんとできたんだヨ～！", "zh": "右手和右脚、左手和左脚，要同时往前伸。\n只要注意这点，就能好好跳出来了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1008_p", "source_sha256": "72fa0bf5fc28d455b71d180599a02005cd4e5de680913668d4e9c2255d70ae19", "ja": "なるほど。特訓の成果ってわけだな。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，这是特训的成果啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "faf8fd9573703ecf83db1176844935769fe46ba0ca1e816d1e6b69fa14cdff01", "ja": "ウン！　他にも、おしとやかさを教えてもらったり\nしたヨ。あのネ……こんな感じ。", "zh": "嗯！我还请教了淑女般的举止。那个……就像这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "2f795c4ea83bb4df797a664c8c15f5bf196aca8a5debe562f3348d15f9ea591e", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nワタクシと一差、舞ってくださいまし？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n您可愿与妾身共舞一曲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "ec32d6a05276c5dd822cf7888b5555296a1df65009b1356207a532fee8c1732f", "ja": "とかネ～♪　……ウン？\nキョトンとしちゃって、どうかしたノ～？", "zh": "之类的嘛～♪……嗯？\n怎么一副发愣的样子～？发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ed080ef900246bfb8f0a699f83c8128394044b46f780cfda8029806f2f4823d1", "ja": "あ、いや……急だったから。\nちょっとビックリしただけだよ、うん。", "zh": "啊，不是……只是太突然了。\n稍微吓了一跳而已，嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1014_p", "source_sha256": "395c4900e3715d82b0d620e59706ec2e9d81a47ccd80bc44b3ad202e85540066", "ja": "そういうエレナも、新鮮でいいな。\nいつもの元気いっぱいなエレナも可愛いけど。", "zh": "这样的艾蕾娜也很新鲜，不错呢。\n平时总是活力满满的艾蕾娜也很可爱就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "b7e1927c20d43986137fae5244605c6b7fdbabebb1edb68e4cdc5fe24e49fb58", "ja": "ワオ、ありがとっ♪\n頑張って練習してよかったヨ～！", "zh": "哇，谢谢你♪\n努力练习真是太好了哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "778ed9ed303bc7509e6100735f485a93b108d5b9b1f2438ac2b87969a0b513a4", "ja": "でも……お祭り、もう終わっちゃうんだよネ。\nさみしいナ～……アンコールはないノ？", "zh": "但是……庆典已经要结束了呢。\n好寂寞啊～……没有安可吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1017_p", "source_sha256": "453ee395163bec4a9a5704aef8bf7e8c70fded2ca4273a4d0b09a0cb6e6bb5a4", "ja": "お祭りにアンコールはないだろうな……。\nまあ、確かにちょっと寂しいよな。", "zh": "祭典应该不会有返场吧……\n不过，确实感觉有点寂寞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7be49d1b482245b0a19caa68a198337b6ec1452f1d26d9ae73fe18e611284dc3", "ja": "でも、帰っていくお客さん達、みんないい笑顔だし。\nきっと満足してもらえたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不过，回去的客人们脸上都带着灿烂的笑容。\n他们应该都满意了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "d03a286d50032e6450a19c9213ffaedc35950118b6562cac0d2ff76f95758395", "ja": "だったらうれしいナ～♪　お祭りが終わっても、\nさみしくないくらい、楽しかったらいいネ。", "zh": "那样的话我就开心啦～♪ 就算庆典结束了，也希望大家能开心到不会感到寂寞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1020_p", "source_sha256": "172f19067113c666d70f8e0d9dc4fa78ee9e660f7b7a12112e579366fd9e0b7b", "ja": "ああ。それに、来年だってあるしな。\n楽しみに待って、また踊りに来よう！", "zh": "啊。而且明年也还有机会嘛。期待着下次再来跳舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "50476bafa5904dabf3144773199da7d37cf3778e7e8b68583a2c1dfb99761889", "ja": "ウン！　そうだよネ……エヘヘ♪\nなんだか、さみしいのが、どっかいっちゃたカモ！", "zh": "嗯！确实是这样呢……嘿嘿♪\n不知不觉，寂寞好像跑到哪里去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "2e8551d1495696128816ec99d495cb5acf03dae1d9994856ee9e1a1b17506854", "ja": "でもワタシは、まだまだ踊り足りないナ～。\n今からふたりで、ちょっとだけ……あ、ううん。", "zh": "不过我还没跳够呢～  \n现在我们两个，再跳一会儿……啊，不，没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0244_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "2f795c4ea83bb4df797a664c8c15f5bf196aca8a5debe562f3348d15f9ea591e", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nワタクシと一差、舞ってくださいまし？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n您可愿与妾身共舞一曲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
